-- `l4 batch` runs a PRINTED copy of the module. A pattern variable named
-- like a later input could capture that input's test once the module was
-- printed from what the clauses compile to, and the printed module was
-- ambiguous; printed as the clauses the drafter wrote, it is not.

@export capture
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE capture b TRUE  IS 1
DECIDE capture a FALSE IS 2
